  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>To find&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>We know that</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Given</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 300px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mi>k</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is correct.</p>",
